	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Tier-3 motor encoder flex landing: 6 bare pads 0.6x1.8mm at 1.0mm pitch for a tin-and-iron flex attach, place at a board edge with the flex arriving from the pin-1 mark side. Mates Flex_Fingers_1x06_P1.0mm. Pin order GND 3V3 ENCA ENCB VNTC GND. Pad length 1.8 mm: sized to the SG90 swap board, where the row lands in the ~2.4 mm strip between the motor can (x 0.5) and the pot leg pads (x -1.9) after a ~0.5 mm fold.")
